                      |CKBDarkwind's Guide to New Adventurers
                      |BKB-----------------------------------

|YKOWelcome to Darkwind. This edition of the Newbie Tome follows the same
road as |YKBhelp guide|YKO: first steps, safe combat, exploration, guilds,
the economy, community, and the long climb beyond level 100.

A short tutorial starts automatically for new characters. In Darkflow it
appears in a hover window; every client can use |YKBtutorial|YKO to review
the current step and |YKBtutorial continue|YKO to continue. The tutorial
teaches by doing, while this tome explains why those actions matter.

Carry the tome and use:

  |YKBread tome|YKO            Show the table of contents
  |YKBread introduction|YKO    Read this page
  |YKBread chapter <number>|YKO
  |YKBcheckout guilds|YKO      List current guild checkout pages
  |YKBcheckout <guild>|YKO     Read about one guild

The help system is always more detailed and easier to update than any book.
Use |YKBhelp <topic>|YKO, |YKBhelp list|YKO, and |YKBhelp guide|YKO whenever
you want the latest reference.

The tome marks your reading progress as you go. More importantly, ask
questions on the |YKBnewbie|YKO channel. Darkwind is large, and nobody is
expected to learn it alone.|000

                    Segovia Loire
